%% Lifecycle of one receivable in the pool contract (design, Tranche 1). Statuses are appended, never edited.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Screened: TruMarket checks documents,<br/>buyer, limits (off-chain)
  Screened --> Attested: attest(key, hash),<br/>recorder + second approver
  Attested --> Funded: release(key), admin multisig,<br/>90% of face to the payout account
  Funded --> Repaid: settle(key, amount),<br/>waterfall applied
  Repaid --> [*]
  Funded --> Overdue: set_status overdue
  Overdue --> Repaid: buyer pays late, settle
  Overdue --> Claim: set_status claim,<br/>insurance claim filed
  Claim --> Loss: set_status loss,<br/>uncovered part written down in NAV
  Funded --> Claim: quality claim
  Attested --> Revoked: set_status revoked,<br/>never funded
  Loss --> [*]
  Revoked --> [*]
